{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Who has preceded me that I should repay</b> — הקדימני: in the sense of two who contend with each other and say: if you defeat me, I will give you such and such. So too הקדימני, for I will repay if he defeats me, for everything under the heavens is mine."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:33.266482322Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}